<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-25455] ZookeeperDiscoSPI Suite1: reduce GC pressure to avoid OOM</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-25455</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ZookeeperDiscoveryTopologyChangeAndReconnectTest#testLargeUserAttribute* tests create big objects that get into ZK commit log in multiple copies and create excessive GC pressure.&lt;br/&gt;
&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
It is possible to reduce required memory consumption without compromizing tests&apos; logic.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
