                            <comment id="17954329" author="sergeychugunov" created="Tue, 27 May 2025 12:58:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;As code change covers only test code, there&apos;s no need for a full-fledged visa.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Related suites of ZooKeeper tests look all green: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci2.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_ZooKeeperDiscovery1&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F12089%2Fhead&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;suite 1&lt;/a&gt; (21 run, no OOMs), &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci2.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_ZooKeeperDiscovery2&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F12089%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;suite 2&lt;/a&gt; (5 runs, OOM never appered in it), &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci2.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_ZooKeeperDiscovery3&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F12089%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;suite 3&lt;/a&gt; (5 runs), &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci2.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_ZooKeeperDiscovery4&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeStatusDiv&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F12089%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;suite 4&lt;/a&gt; (5 runs).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
